IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aca-care`

-- Aged Care Act 2024 (Cth), ss 7, 9(2), 10, 23, 24, 56, 58, 61, 62, 65-68, 71-73, 84, 86, 273, 277-282, 296, 298, 301, 305, 319 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or the Aged Care Rules 2025, which are not deposited.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_aged-care-act-2024_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts (c097, Chloe's life): Chloe Harding, born 14 March 2003, not recorded as an Aboriginal or Torres Strait
-- Islander person, aged 82 in June 2085, living in her own strata apartment in Mandurah, gets a Support at Home package
-- after an aged care assessment. Her care needs, the services and hours, every contribution rate, price, threshold,
-- supplement amount and the basic age pension amount are HYPOTHETICAL and labelled where used.

§ `Fixtures`

