    `I have applied for access` IS TRUE
    `an eligibility determination is in effect for me` IS TRUE
    `I have undergone an aged care needs assessment` IS TRUE
    `an access approval covering the service is in effect for me` IS TRUE
    `a classification decision for ongoing home support is in effect for me` IS TRUE
    `the rules excuse me from prioritisation for ongoing home support` IS FALSE
    `a priority category decision has been made for me` IS TRUE
    `the rules excuse me from a place allocation for ongoing home support` IS FALSE
    `a place has been allocated to me` IS TRUE
    `a provider's start notification names a start day for me` IS TRUE
    `the start day is within the period the rules prescribe` IS TRUE

